- **New:** `...(1) the Form Reference Guide sheet carries no wage-type-to-report-row mapping, because no Belgian report specification yet exists to supply those row numbers;...`

CZ has no equivalent cell — its Version Control sheet has no REMARKS table at row 18 — so I preserved the existing statement's meaning rather than importing text. The replacement clears the full marker list (`placeholder|TODO|TBD|FIXME|XXX|VERIFY No.|to be confirmed|to be verified|<insert`).

